{#
    Under the transparency sentence of the directory, on an instance restricted to a territory
    (INSTANCE_TERRITORY, docs/INSTANCE.md): what the directory covers. Nothing otherwise.
#}
{% if instance.territory.isRestricted() %}
    <p class="mt-2 flex max-w-2xl items-start gap-2 text-sm text-ink-soft" data-directory-territory>
        <twig:ux:icon name="lucide:map" class="mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-sage-dark" />
        <span>
            Cet annuaire couvre {{ instance.territory.name ?: 'le territoire de ' ~ instance.name }} : seuls les points de retrait et de livraison situés sur ce territoire y figurent.
        </span>
    </p>
{% endif %}
